<div class="process-summary-grid"><section class="card"><h2>Aging per Tahap</h2><p class="muted">Rata-rata dari riwayat masuk tahap yang tercatat.</p>@foreach($stages as $stage)@php($count=$stageCounts->get($stage->id))<a class="process-summary-row" href="{{ $processUrl(['mode'=>'table','current_stage_id'=>$stage->id]) }}"><span>{{ $stage->name }}</span><strong>{{ $count?->average_age!==null ? round($count->average_age/24,1).' hari' : 'Belum tercatat' }}</strong><span class="process-danger">{{ $count?->overdue??0 }} overdue</span></a>@endforeach</section><section class="card"><h2>Beban Kerja per CS</h2><p class="muted">Jumlah kasus memberi konteks; gunakan SLA dan kualitas saat menilai pekerjaan.</p>@forelse($workload as $member)<a class="process-summary-row" href="{{ $processUrl(['mode'=>'table','assigned_cs_id'=>$member->assigned_cs_id,'exception'=>$member->assigned_cs_id?null:'no_owner']) }}"><span>{{ $member->cs_name??'Belum ditugaskan' }}</span><strong>{{ $member->total }} aktif</strong><span class="process-danger">{{ $member->overdue }} overdue</span></a>@empty<p class="muted">Tidak ada lamaran aktif sesuai filter.</p>@endforelse</section><section class="card"><h2>Bottleneck Mitra / Lowongan</h2>@forelse($bottlenecks as $item)<a class="process-summary-row" href="{{ $processUrl(['mode'=>'table','vacancy_id'=>$item->vacancy_id]) }}"><span>{{ $item->vacancy_label }}<small>{{ $item->company_label }}</small></span><strong>{{ $item->total }}</strong><span class="process-danger">{{ $item->overdue }} overdue</span></a>@empty<p class="muted">Belum ada bottleneck sesuai filter.</p>@endforelse</section><section class="card"><h2>Kualitas Proses</h2>@foreach($exceptions as $key=>$count)<a class="process-summary-row" href="{{ $processUrl(['mode'=>'table','exception'=>$key]) }}"><span>{{ $process::EXCEPTIONS[$key] }}</span><strong>{{ $count }}</strong></a>@endforeach</section><section class="card"><h2>Tren Tugas Overdue & Keberangkatan</h2><p class="muted">7 hari terakhir dalam scope filter. Overdue dihitung dari deadline dan penyelesaian tugas yang tercatat.</p><div class="process-trend">@foreach($trends as $day)<a href="{{ $processUrl(['mode'=>'table','queue'=>'overdue']) }}"><div class="process-trend-bars"><span style="height:{{ max(3,$day['overdue']*90/max(1,$trends->max('overdue'))) }}px" title="{{ $day['overdue'] }} lamaran dengan tugas overdue"></span><span style="height:{{ max(3,$day['departures']*90/max(1,$trends->max('departures'))) }}px" title="{{ $day['departures'] }} keberangkatan"></span></div><small>{{ $day['date'] }}</small><strong>{{ $day['overdue'] }} / {{ $day['departures'] }}</strong></a>@endforeach</div><small>Merah: lamaran dengan tugas overdue · Hijau: keberangkatan selesai</small></section><section class="card"><h2>Distribusi Kendala</h2>@forelse($blockerDistribution as $blocker)<a class="process-summary-row" href="{{ $processUrl(['mode'=>'table','kpi'=>'blocked']) }}"><span>{{ \App\Models\ApplicationBlocker::label($blocker->category) }}</span><strong>{{ $blocker->total }}</strong></a>@empty<p class="muted">Tidak ada kendala aktif sesuai filter.</p>@endforelse</section></div>
